<BaseLayout title="About" backHref={base} backLabel="Home">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    Most of the content on this site was generated using Claude and spot checked by a human, with the exception 
    being some of the guides and the page you're reading now.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before making this site, I kept finding myself asking AI questions about ships and maps in this game,
    and I figured it might be better to just have it generate that stuff once via this site 
    (and then make it available to anyone who wanted it), so that's what this is.
  </p>

